{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29565","headline":"酬别令狐补阙 · 李商隐","name":"酬别令狐补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惜别夏仍半，回途秋已期。\n那修直谏草，更赋赠行诗。\n锦段知无报，青萍肯见疑。\n人生有通塞，公等系安危。\n警露鹤辞侣，吸风蝉抱枝。\n弹冠如不问，又到扫门时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}